# RESTLESS: hidden spots, touched, give each half's rewards in their order
# (the Greenwood Gate: an egg, three coins, a gold jar). Blink the owlet
# flies to the nearest one and blinks. Hidden spots per half: 3, 4, 4, 4, 4,
# 3 (7, 8 and 7 a stage, four of them eggs).
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
expect secrets == 3
cheat owl
cheat pos 1000 144
wait 30
expect owl_target >= 0
cheat goto_secret 0
wait 2
expect secrets_found == 1
expect items_4 == 3
cheat half 1
expect secrets == 4
cheat half 2
expect secrets == 4
cheat half 3
expect secrets == 4
cheat half 4
expect secrets == 4
cheat half 5
expect secrets == 3
